a(b | regex: a ( without its ), at character 1
a)b | regex: a ) without its (, at character 1
[abc | regex: a [ without its ], at character 0
*a | regex: nothing to repeat before "*", at character 0
a{3,1} | regex: a count from 0 to 1000, the smaller first, at character 1
x\ | regex: a \ at the end
[z-a] | regex: the range z-a goes backwards, at character 4
[\D] | regex: \D inside [ ], at character 1: write [^...] instead
^* | regex: nothing to repeat before "*", at character 1
